SOAPBOX: Part time and all search and pounce. All contacts made with a 40 meter EFHW up 20 feet except for 2 contacts made on 80 meters using my 68 foot vertical. Very little activity on 10 meters and 15 meters due to poor propagation whereas 20 meters was active around the clock with excellent propagation into EU and VK/ZL at night. I should have spent more time on 40 meters but my operating time was limited. This is a great contest for keeping ones CW skills at a high level and I really enjoyed it. 73, Don wd8dsb
